      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC DEUCE (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 19.61. Draws out wide but goes well over this trip. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Form reads well for this. CASHED UP RHI (2) is in hot form winning her last two on end, the latest jumping from this same box to score in a P5 at Q Parklands (29.98). Can measure up again. RUN BURGUNDY (5) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including seven wins. Comes off a (19.74) win last time, scoring by a neck in a Grade 5 over 366m at this track. Can feature in the finish. KACHINA RIPPLE (1) is a chance after winning last time.",
